		"Instead, &4&lon death&r you will lose:&r"
		""
		"- &n25 &oflat&r durability, AND &n15% &ototal&r durability"
		""
		"on &l&4all items&r in your inventory"
		"(Including worn and NOT including cosmetic slots)"
	]
